            "id": "levelled_description_eb4d951af767",
            "level": {
              "value": 9
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You possess fiendish magic. Choose two of the following spells: disguise magic, false vitality, invisibility, see the unseen, shatter, or paranoia. You can use each of the chosen spells once per day as 2nd-rank divine innate spells.\n\nGrimspawn typically take false vitality and see the unseen, pitborn typically take paranoia and shatter, and hellspawn typically take invisibility and disguise magic."
            }
          }
        }
